                "text": "Today\u2019s budget resolution sets the table for compassionate improvements to Medicare, Medicaid, & Social Security. We can and will protect benefits for the most vulnerable among us while also rooting out the waste, fraud, and abuse. I'm grateful for @SpeakerJohnson's commitment to safeguarding these programs for those most in need.",
