                "reply_count": 9,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I had a great conversation with Troy Hewitt, owner of Hewitt Docks, Lifts & Pontoon Legs, when I stopped into their facility in Nicollet this week. We talked about some of the burdens their business is facing with increasing insurance costs and government overregulation, both of which impact their growth and bottom line.\n\n#MN01 family-owned operations, like Hewitt, are exactly why I introduced my legislation, the Prove It Act \u2013 to make life easier for our small businesses by giving them a greater voice in the regulatory process.",
