                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Good to be in Luverne on Friday to touch base with the folks from @candboperations. As a leading farm equipment distributor in the Midwest, I appreciated hearing from their team about their legislative priorities, like strengthening crop insurance programs in the Farm Bill, extending the 2017 tax cuts, and ways we can create better markets for our local farmers and manufacturers.",
