                "reply_count": 9,
                "retweet_count": 11,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Walz administration has made a fiscal mess of the public programs in our state.\n\n\u274c$250M Feeding Our Future scandal\n\u274c2 FBI raids at autism centers for Medicaid fraud\n\u274c62 investigations into federally funded childcare centers\n\u274c$6M in CCAP funding stolen from taxpayers\n\nMinnesotans deserve better. It\u2019s time we restore fiscal discipline, program integrity, and public trust in our taxpayer funded programs. Today, I led my colleagues in calling on @GovTimWalz and legislative leaders to put a stop to the rampant waste, fraud, and abuse.",
